    "detailed_description": "&quot;Get ready to embark on a unique adventure in Dragon Ranch! This cooperative online game invites you to grow your own farm and capture cute monsters in a world full of charm and hidden secrets. Team up with your friends and together explore the vast landscapes in search of clues to an ancient civilization.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTeam up with your friends and take on challenging quests to capture the rarest and most valuable monsters. Upgrade your ranch with new facilities, create custom habitats and experiment with genetics to breed even more powerful and unique monsters!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBut it's not all work and no play at the ranch. Explore this strange planet full of hidden secrets as you unravel the history and discover the mysteries behind these enigmatic beings.",
